  "jei.deepnullreforged.desc": "The DeepNull is a spiritual successor and upgraded version of the OpenBlocks /dev/null/.",
  "jei.deepnullreforged.desc0": "The Redstone DeepNull (MK I) is the lowest tier with 9 slots and up to 2 stacks in each slot.",
  "jei.deepnullreforged.desc1": "The Lapis DeepNull (MK II) is the 2nd tier with 18 slots and up to 4 stacks in each slot.",
  "jei.deepnullreforged.desc2": "The Iron DeepNull (MK III) is the 3rd tier with 27 slots and up to 8 stacks in each slot.",
  "jei.deepnullreforged.desc3": "The Gold DeepNull (MK IV) is the 4th tier with 36 slots and up to 16 stacks in each slot.",
  "jei.deepnullreforged.desc4": "The Diamond DeepNull (MK V) is the 5th tier with 45 slots and up to 32 stacks in each slot.",
